268 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 132 0 R
/E (The use of deep learning has proven to be effective in the early detection of neurological disorders through the analysis of complicated medical data, which can easily be detected through patterns that would have been hard to detect through conventional approaches. While some problems like data scarcity and non-interpretability continue to hinder the use of deep learning, continued technological advancements will help solve these problems. In the future, deep learning will prove to be very important in the early diagnosis of diseases and personalizing treatments.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
