/P 135 0 R
/E (By 2026, silicon photonics has reached a critical inflection point. The global market is estimated to be valued at approximately $3.5 billion, with rapid growth driven primarily by the increasing demand for high-performance computing and artificial intelligence applications [2][3].)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
333 0 obj
<<
