/P 1217 0 R
/E (Photonic Computing: Continued research into photonic neural networks and optical computing could unlock entirely new paradigms of computation.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
355 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 136 0 R
/E (These developments will determine how quickly photonics transitions from a complementary technology to a foundational element of computing systems.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [15]
>>
