/E (Around the same time, a major airline's chatbot gave a passenger incorrect information about bereavement fare policies. The passenger booked a flight based on that information, was denied the discount, and sued. The court ruled in the passenger's favor. The company had deployed the chatbot without building in any mechanism for human escalation on sensitive policy questions.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [8]
>>
